  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/rascal-does-not-dream-gui-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252frascal-does-not-dream-gui-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Kesselspacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkesselot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/documentation/website_vector.svg\" alt=\"官方網站\"></a></p>\n<h1>簡介</h1>\n<p>源自人氣動漫／輕小說《青春豬頭少年不會夢到兔女郎學姊》。享受全面重製的 Minecraft GUI 體驗，搭配所有可愛的女角色們，當然還有主角梓川。 </p>\n<h1>預覽圖 - 更多內容請查看圖庫！</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/NGWpI5eV/images/47b561f5e991e2293aa15d355b32ef15c24a291c.png\" alt=\"大型箱子介面\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/NGWpI5eV/images/802185aabcfa3257f04fa8da5babec72b139d005.png\" alt=\"鐵砧介面\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/NGWpI5eV/images/27902da0f03d1c9dbbc035d24bf62548ad7e4166.png\" alt=\"鍛造台介面\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/39e1d151-f787-4346-9014-f14dc996f94e.webp\" alt=\"Bisecthosting 宣傳橫幅\"></a></p>\n<h3>資源包注意事項</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>如果您是 YouTube 創作者或內容創作者並使用此資源包，請在描述中附上連結指向本頁面，以便讓其他人知道您所使用的資源包。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>不允許在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上重新上傳此資源包或任何修改版本，這包括重新發布至任何其他網站。</strong> （<em>除非獲得本人的明確許可</em>）</li>\n</ul>",
